{"seq":5,"slug":"deployment-modes","title":"OpenClaw 四种部署形态","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/personal-agents/personal-agents-snapshot/openclaw/deployment-modes","wordCount":1211,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"openclaw-四种部署形态\">OpenClaw 四种部署形态</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>OpenClaw 二进制本身是单一可执行体，但落地到不同设备 / 操作系统 / 网络环境时，需要选不同的进程托管方式。官方文档把这件事抽象成四种部署形态：<strong>launchd（macOS 开发机常驻）</strong>、<strong>systemd（Linux 服务器常驻）</strong>、<strong>Docker 容器（K8s 或隔离环境）</strong>、<strong>iOS node（移动随身节点）</strong>。本节横向对比 trade-off，并给出&quot;什么场景选哪种&quot;的决策路径。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  scene[OpenClaw 部署形态]&#10;  scene --&gt; m1[launchd&lt;br/&gt;macOS dev]&#10;  scene --&gt; m2[systemd&lt;br/&gt;Linux server]&#10;  scene --&gt; m3[Docker&lt;br/&gt;容器/K8s]&#10;  scene --&gt; m4[iOS node&lt;br/&gt;移动随身]&#10;  m1 --&gt; r1[本地常驻 + GUI 协同]&#10;  m2 --&gt; r2[生产常驻 + 多 tenant]&#10;  m3 --&gt; r3[隔离环境 + 易回滚]&#10;  m4 --&gt; r4[随身节点 + 边缘转发]\">flowchart TD\n  scene[OpenClaw 部署形态]\n  scene --&gt; m1[launchd&lt;br/&gt;macOS dev]\n  scene --&gt; m2[systemd&lt;br/&gt;Linux server]\n  scene --&gt; m3[Docker&lt;br/&gt;容器/K8s]\n  scene --&gt; m4[iOS node&lt;br/&gt;移动随身]\n  m1 --&gt; r1[本地常驻 + GUI 协同]\n  m2 --&gt; r2[生产常驻 + 多 tenant]\n  m3 --&gt; r3[隔离环境 + 易回滚]\n  m4 --&gt; r4[随身节点 + 边缘转发]</pre><p>四种形态并不互斥：典型企业用户会同时跑 systemd + Docker，开发者会同时跑 launchd + iOS node。</p>\n<h2 id=\"形态一-launchd-macos-本地常驻\">形态一：launchd（macOS 本地常驻）</h2><p><strong>适用场景</strong>：macOS 桌面开发机，开发者本人主要工作站；希望 OpenClaw 跟随登录自动起、退出登录自动关、与 Claude Code 等 GUI 工具共生。</p>\n<p>launchd 是 macOS 的原生进程托管器，本地常驻成本最低、与系统集成最深。安装路径上一节 <a href=\"install-and-first-tenant\"><code>3_install-and-first-tenant.md</code></a> 已经走过 npm / Homebrew；这里只补充 launchd plist：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"xml\" data-code=\"&lt;?xml version=&quot;1.0&quot; encoding=&quot;UTF-8&quot;?&gt;&#10;&lt;plist version=&quot;1.0&quot;&gt;&#10;&lt;dict&gt;&#10;  &lt;key&gt;Label&lt;/key&gt;&#10;  &lt;string&gt;com.openclaw.agent&lt;/string&gt;&#10;  &lt;key&gt;ProgramArguments&lt;/key&gt;&#10;  &lt;array&gt;&#10;    &lt;string&gt;/usr/local/bin/openclaw&lt;/string&gt;&#10;    &lt;string&gt;mcp-serve&lt;/string&gt;&#10;    &lt;string&gt;--port&lt;/string&gt;&#10;    &lt;string&gt;8765&lt;/string&gt;&#10;  &lt;/array&gt;&#10;  &lt;key&gt;RunAtLoad&lt;/key&gt;&#10;  &lt;true/&gt;&#10;  &lt;key&gt;KeepAlive&lt;/key&gt;&#10;  &lt;true/&gt;&#10;  &lt;key&gt;StandardOutPath&lt;/key&gt;&#10;  &lt;string&gt;/tmp/openclaw.log&lt;/string&gt;&#10;&lt;/dict&gt;&#10;&lt;/plist&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;?</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">xml</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> encoding</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"UTF-8\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">?></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">plist</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">dict</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>Label&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>com.openclaw.agent&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>ProgramArguments&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>/usr/local/bin/openclaw&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>mcp-serve&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>--port&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>8765&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>RunAtLoad&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">/></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>KeepAlive&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">/></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>StandardOutPath&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>/tmp/openclaw.log&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">dict</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">plist</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><p>放到 <code>~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.openclaw.agent.plist</code>，然后 <code>launchctl load -w</code> 加载即可。</p>\n<p><strong>优势</strong>：开机自启、KeepAlive 自动恢复、与 Keychain 原生集成。\n<strong>劣势</strong>：仅 macOS、单机部署、不适合多人共享。</p>\n<h2 id=\"形态二-systemd-linux-服务器常驻\">形态二：systemd（Linux 服务器常驻）</h2><p><strong>适用场景</strong>：Linux 服务器、生产环境、多 tenant 共享一台机器；需要稳定 24×7 跑、与现有 syslog / journald 集成、可被运维标准化纳管。</p>\n<p>systemd unit 模板：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ini\" data-code=\"[Unit]&#10;Description=OpenClaw multi-tenant agent&#10;After=network-online.target&#10;&#10;[Service]&#10;Type=simple&#10;ExecStart=/usr/local/bin/openclaw mcp-serve --port 8765&#10;Restart=on-failure&#10;RestartSec=5s&#10;User=openclaw&#10;Group=openclaw&#10;WorkingDirectory=/var/lib/openclaw&#10;StandardOutput=journal&#10;StandardError=journal&#10;&#10;[Install]&#10;WantedBy=multi-user.target\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>[Unit]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Description=OpenClaw multi-tenant agent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>After=network-online.target</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[Service]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Type=simple</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ExecStart=/usr/local/bin/openclaw mcp-serve --port 8765</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Restart=on-failure</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RestartSec=5s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>User=openclaw</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Group=openclaw</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WorkingDirectory=/var/lib/openclaw</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>StandardOutput=journal</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>StandardError=journal</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[Install]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WantedBy=multi-user.target</span></span></code></pre></div><p>放到 <code>/etc/systemd/system/openclaw.service</code>，<code>systemctl enable --now openclaw</code> 即开机自启 + 立刻拉起。日志走 journald，<code>journalctl -u openclaw -f</code> 实时查看。</p>\n<p><strong>优势</strong>：Linux 生态标准、Restart 策略丰富、journald 集成、易于纳入运维监控。\n<strong>劣势</strong>：仅 Linux、不带容器隔离（多 tenant 共用 host 文件系统）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"形态三-docker-容器-k8s-集群\">形态三：Docker（容器 / K8s 集群）</h2><p><strong>适用场景</strong>：需要完全环境隔离、跑在 K8s 集群、CI/CD 流水线里、或希望快速版本回滚的团队。</p>\n<p>最小 docker-compose：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"version: &#39;3.8&#39;&#10;services:&#10;  openclaw:&#10;    image: openclaw/openclaw:latest&#10;    ports:&#10;      - &#39;8080:8080&#39;&#10;      - &#39;8765:8765&#39;&#10;    volumes:&#10;      - ./data:/root/.openclaw&#10;    environment:&#10;      - OPENCLAW_LOG_LEVEL=info&#10;    restart: unless-stopped\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'3.8'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">services</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  openclaw</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    image</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">openclaw/openclaw:latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    ports</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'8080:8080'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'8765:8765'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    volumes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">./data:/root/.openclaw</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    environment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">OPENCLAW_LOG_LEVEL=info</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    restart</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">unless-stopped</span></span></code></pre></div><p>K8s 部署只需把上面映射到 Deployment + PVC + Service 三件套；多副本场景把 storage 换成 NFS 或 cloud volume 即可。</p>\n<p><strong>优势</strong>：环境完全隔离、镜像版本可固定、回滚一行 <code>docker compose pull</code> + restart 即可；天然适合 K8s。\n<strong>劣势</strong>：端口映射 / 卷挂载需显式配置、容器内访问 macOS Keychain 等系统能力受限。</p>\n<h2 id=\"形态四-ios-node-移动随身节点\">形态四：iOS node（移动随身节点）</h2><p><strong>适用场景</strong>：开发者希望在 iPhone / iPad 上跑一个 OpenClaw 节点，作为&quot;随身边缘转发器&quot;——出差时本地节点收 chat platform webhook，再通过反向 MCP 同步给笔记本上的 coding agent。</p>\n<p>iOS node 不是把完整 OpenClaw 装到 iOS——iOS 沙箱不允许常驻 daemon。它的实现路径是：OpenClaw 提供轻量 iOS 客户端 app，与桌面端通过 OpenClaw 自研的 sync protocol 双向同步 persona 状态。iOS 端负责&quot;收消息 + 缓存 + push 通知&quot;，桌面端负责&quot;实际推理 + 路由决策&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong>优势</strong>：移动设备也能收到 persona 消息、出差时不离线、可作为多设备 mesh 节点。\n<strong>劣势</strong>：能力受 iOS 沙箱限制、依赖桌面端常驻配合、网络断时仅缓存不推理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"四形态横向对比\">四形态横向对比</h2><p>把四种形态按八个维度横向铺开，便于决策：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>launchd</th>\n<th>systemd</th>\n<th>Docker</th>\n<th>iOS node</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>平台</td>\n<td>macOS</td>\n<td>Linux</td>\n<td>跨平台</td>\n<td>iOS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>常驻 vs 按需</td>\n<td>常驻</td>\n<td>常驻</td>\n<td>常驻</td>\n<td>常驻+缓存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>隔离强度</td>\n<td>进程级</td>\n<td>进程级 + user</td>\n<td>容器级强隔离</td>\n<td>沙箱级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资源占用</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中（镜像层）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>升级回滚</td>\n<td>brew upgrade</td>\n<td>apt + restart</td>\n<td>image tag 切换</td>\n<td>App Store</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多 tenant 共存</td>\n<td>单机多实例</td>\n<td>推荐</td>\n<td>一容器一 tenant</td>\n<td>单 persona</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>调试便捷度</td>\n<td>Console.app</td>\n<td>journalctl</td>\n<td>docker logs</td>\n<td>iOS 端有限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>推荐场景</td>\n<td>个人开发机</td>\n<td>团队 / 生产</td>\n<td>K8s / 隔离 / CI</td>\n<td>随身边缘</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"决策路径\">决策路径</h2><p>直接的&quot;什么场景选哪种&quot;决策路径：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  q1{什么设备}&#10;  q1 --&gt;|macOS 开发机| q2{多 persona？}&#10;  q1 --&gt;|Linux server| sysd[systemd]&#10;  q1 --&gt;|K8s 集群| dkr[Docker]&#10;  q1 --&gt;|iPhone/iPad| ios[iOS node]&#10;  q2 --&gt;|是 多实例| sysd&#10;  q2 --&gt;|否 单 persona| lch[launchd]\">flowchart TD\n  q1{什么设备}\n  q1 --&gt;|macOS 开发机| q2{多 persona？}\n  q1 --&gt;|Linux server| sysd[systemd]\n  q1 --&gt;|K8s 集群| dkr[Docker]\n  q1 --&gt;|iPhone/iPad| ios[iOS node]\n  q2 --&gt;|是 多实例| sysd\n  q2 --&gt;|否 单 persona| lch[launchd]</pre><p>经验法则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>个人 macOS 开发机</strong>：launchd 起步，单实例足够。</li>\n<li><strong>企业 Linux 生产</strong>：systemd 起步，需要多 tenant 强隔离时升级到 Docker。</li>\n<li><strong>K8s 集群</strong>：Docker 是唯一合理选项。</li>\n<li><strong>多设备同步</strong>：桌面跑 launchd / systemd + iOS 上装 iOS node app。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"陷阱与常见问题\">陷阱与常见问题</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>launchd 装到 LaunchDaemons 而不是 LaunchAgents</strong>：前者以 root 跑、后者跟用户会话；OpenClaw 需要访问 Keychain，必须放 LaunchAgents。</li>\n<li><strong>systemd unit 跑 root</strong>：违反最小权限原则；建议建专用 user <code>openclaw</code> 并 <code>chown</code> 数据目录。</li>\n<li><strong>Docker 没挂卷</strong>：容器重建后 persona / audit log 全丢；务必 <code>-v</code> 挂卷。</li>\n<li><strong>K8s 多副本未同步 storage</strong>：两副本各自写 SQLite，路由规则脑裂；多副本必须共享 NFS / cloud volume。</li>\n<li><strong>iOS node 当推理节点</strong>：iOS 端只做收消息与缓存，桌面端不在线时不要指望它做路由决策。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>四种部署形态：launchd（macOS 开发机）/ systemd（Linux 生产）/ Docker（K8s 隔离）/ iOS node（移动随身）。</li>\n<li>选择维度：平台、隔离强度、资源占用、升级回滚、多 tenant、调试便捷度。</li>\n<li>常见组合：launchd + iOS node（个人多设备）、systemd + Docker（企业 + K8s）。</li>\n<li>下一篇 <a href=\"security-and-audit\"><code>6_security-and-audit.md</code></a> 讲 per-tenant key 隔离与 audit log 设计。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"OpenClaw 四种部署形态","id":"openclaw-四种部署形态"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"形态一：launchd（macOS 本地常驻）","id":"形态一-launchd-macos-本地常驻"},{"level":2,"text":"形态二：systemd（Linux 服务器常驻）","id":"形态二-systemd-linux-服务器常驻"},{"level":2,"text":"形态三：Docker（容器 / K8s 集群）","id":"形态三-docker-容器-k8s-集群"},{"level":2,"text":"形态四：iOS node（移动随身节点）","id":"形态四-ios-node-移动随身节点"},{"level":2,"text":"四形态横向对比","id":"四形态横向对比"},{"level":2,"text":"决策路径","id":"决策路径"},{"level":2,"text":"陷阱与常见问题","id":"陷阱与常见问题"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"OpenClaw chat-platform 接入","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/personal-agents/personal-agents-snapshot/openclaw/chat-platform-onboarding"},"next":{"title":"OpenClaw 安全与审计模型","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/personal-agents/personal-agents-snapshot/openclaw/security-and-audit"}}